{"version":1,"content":"<p>荷里活女星莎朗史東（Sharon Stone）於90年代憑賣座情慾懸疑片《本能》（Basic Instinct）走紅，而片中她被執法人員盤問時交叉翹腳故意走光的經典鏡頭令人留下深印象，翹腳亦成為莎姐的招牌動作。</p><p>而最近68歲的莎姐亮相時尚雜誌</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T01:24:24.712125+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T01:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:18:25.479631+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T01:18:25.479631+00:00","content_hash":"4976b1f5bb18fd0d88043e852cdc9fd186baf49d4b29917481899de08c9bf884","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}